flowchart TD
    Start([Route request for function id]) --> ReadInstances[Read instances for function from cache]
    ReadInstances --> InstancesEmpty{Instances length?}
    
    InstancesEmpty -->|Zero| ReadRunnerState[Read requests per runner from cache]
    InstancesEmpty -->|More than zero| FindHealthy[Find first not overloaded instance]
    
    FindHealthy --> HealthyFound{Healthy instance found?}
     HealthyFound -->|No| ReadRunnerState
    HealthyFound -->|Yes| ReturnExisting[Return instance id and runner address]
   
    
    ReadRunnerState --> PickLeastLoaded[Pick least loaded runner]
    PickLeastLoaded --> RunnerAvailable{Runner available?}
    
    RunnerAvailable -->|No| ReturnNoRunner[Error, no runner available]
    RunnerAvailable -->|Yes| PrepareInstance[Command chosen runner to prepare instance]
    
    PrepareInstance --> WaitPrepare[Wait for instance preparation]
    WaitPrepare --> ReturnNew[Return new instance id and runner address]
    
    ReturnExisting --> End([End])
    ReturnNoRunner --> End
    ReturnNew --> End
    
    style Start fill:#90EE90
    style End fill:#FFB6C1
    style ReturnExisting fill:#87CEEB
    style ReturnNoRunner fill:#FFA07A
    style ReturnNew fill:#87CEEB
